{"4510830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Myth of Empires: Throne", "steam_appid": 4510830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/e7352ed9f4896a56befcc89414fad4c7.avif?t=1782481784\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras_big/e7352ed9f4896a56befcc89414fad4c7.avif?t=1782481784 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myth of Empires: Throne can be experienced for free and includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Zhongzhou Map: Composed of diverse terrains including mountains, plains, snowfields, deserts, rainforests, and swamps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Dongzhou Map: Features unique environments such as volcanoes, islands, coastlines, icy regions, peach forests, and bamboo groves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Xizhou Map: A blend of deserts and oases, with numerous unknown cave instance where deadly bosses lie in wait</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Myth of Empires Base Game: Over 1,300 recipes across 7 categories (production, building, weapons, armor, troops, medicinal cuisine, and breeding), 200+ art of war, 500+ achievements, 25 skill talent lines, and 16 nobility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Hellenic Civilization Pack DLC: 12 new armor sets, 15 special weapons, a full set of new building recipes, 1 warship, 6 musical instruments, and 5 building platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Xizhou Civilization Pack DLC: Imperial Fall Devices (automated manufacturing), 5 types of vehicles/devices (Aerial Fortress, Desert Ship, Navigator, Mechanized Woodcutter, Mechanized Horse), 16 powerful weapons, 9 armor sets, 3 rare smelting materials, 2 fine animal saddles, Imperial Fall Structure Recipes, and Endurance Pills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Royal Carriages Pack DLC: 3 types of royal carriages (the Vermilion Carriage, the Dragon Carriage, and the Imperial Carriage)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Musical Instruments DLC: 10 traditional instruments (dizi, guqin, se, pan flute, pipa, sheng, suona, xun, konghou, and chime bells)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ More Content: 5 major professions, Legendary Warriors, Apocalypse Orb gameplay, hired warriors working autonomously, Zip Line, and more</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/41ebd7ec420605ed4a35ec0470670385.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter a Multi-Civilization Sandbox for Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myth of Empires: Throne is free worldwide. No base game purchase required. Step into vast lands inspired by Zhongzhou, Dongzhou, and Xizhou. Begin from nothing in a living world of dynamic day-night cycles and complex ecosystems as you explore, survive, and build your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Faster, Establish Your Power Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season mechanics significantly boost resource production and development efficiency, shortening the early progression phase. Unlock over 1,300 crafting recipes and equipment systems as you rapidly build strongholds and prepare for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tame Creatures and Strengthen Your Forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs, horses, and wild beasts can all be trained and raised to become trusted combat and transport companions. Grow your guild through breeding and training as they aid you in exploration, warfare, and long-range expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 100 Weapons for Dynamic Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield over a hundred melee weapons alongside siege engines and defensive structures. Coordinate troop formations and tactical cooperation to experience diverse warfare across sieges, field battles, and fortress defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal Warfare Against Players Worldwide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Servers reset periodically so all players begin from the same starting point. Expand your dominion through County Battles, Fortress Battles, and cross-server expeditions while competing for world dominance through alliances, diplomacy, and war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/41ebd7ec420605ed4a35ec0470670385.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter a Multi-Civilization Sandbox for Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myth of Empires: Throne is free worldwide. No base game purchase required. Step into vast lands inspired by Zhongzhou, Dongzhou, and Xizhou. Begin from nothing in a living world of dynamic day-night cycles and complex ecosystems as you explore, survive, and build your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/4b744693192903d72c025b5efb382e51.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Faster, Establish Your Power Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season mechanics significantly boost resource production and development efficiency, shortening the early progression phase. Unlock over 1,300 crafting recipes and equipment systems as you rapidly build strongholds and prepare for war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/db6eeafd44d36d8e54acd784b5f05bd8.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tame Creatures and Strengthen Your Forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs, horses, and wild beasts can all be trained and raised to become trusted combat and transport companions. Grow your guild through breeding and training as they aid you in exploration, warfare, and long-range expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/436fad7d84ada06217ee40dfab3b8f69.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 100 Weapons for Dynamic Warfare</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield over a hundred melee weapons alongside siege engines and defensive structures. Coordinate troop formations and tactical cooperation to experience diverse warfare across sieges, field battles, and fortress defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/a0075b2f445510a912b1d1941c26de53.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal Warfare Against Players Worldwide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Servers reset periodically so all players begin from the same starting point. Expand your dominion through County Battles, Fortress Battles, and cross-server expeditions while competing for world dominance through alliances, diplomacy, and war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.poster.avif?t=1782481784\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.webm?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/extras/2a9bc1388430ad682e868fa7fbc4dcee.mp4?t=1782481784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Myth of Empires: Throne is a free seasonal multiplayer warfare sandbox. Explore vast lands inspired by multiple civilizations, tame creatures, forge powerful weapons, and build your guild. Lead cross-server expeditions, conquer territories, and compete with players worldwide for the ultimate throne!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, French, Italian, German, Russian, Czech, Japanese, Polish, Thai, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/e311e00ad9f1a6ce1ee687f367071784a024feb3/header.jpg?t=1782481784", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4510830/0ac197dae80d05423b7305c91a03c9f8956e8f9e